---
// 比較記事ページ。レビュー記事と同じ枠（パンくず・本文・サイドバー・関連レビュー）で表示する
import Layout from "@/layouts/Layout.astro";
import { getCollection } from "astro:content";
import { getImage } from "astro:assets";
import BlogSingleSidebar from "@/components/sidebar/BlogSingleSidebar.astro";
import ComparePostHead from "@/components/pages/compare/ComparePostHead.astro";
import CompareContent from "@/components/pages/compare/CompareContent.astro";
import ReviewPostList from "@/components/pages/review/ReviewPostList.astro";
import Breadcrumb from "@/components/breadcrumb/Breadcrumb.astro";
import { SITE_URL } from "@/data/siteData";

export async function getStaticPaths() {
  const posts = await getCollection("compare", ({ data }) => data.draft === false);
  const reviews = await getCollection("review", ({ data }) => data.draft === false);

  return posts.map((post) => {
    // 記事下: 比較した銘柄のレビューを bottles の順に並べる
    const related = post.data.bottles
      .map((slug) => reviews.find((r) => r.id === slug))
      .filter((r): r is NonNullable<typeof r> => Boolean(r));
    return { params: { slug: post.id }, props: { post, related } };
  });
}

const { post, related } = Astro.props;
const { title, description, image, publishedAt, updatedAt } = post.data;

// 一覧ページ（/compare/）はまだ無いので、パンくずの「飲み比べ」はリンクなし
const breadcrumb = [{ label: "ホーム", href: "/" }, { label: "飲み比べ" }, { label: title }];

const ogImageAsset = await getImage({ src: image, width: 1200, format: "jpg" });
const ogImage = Astro.site ? new URL(ogImageAsset.src, Astro.site).toString() : undefined;

const breadcrumbLd = {
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "BreadcrumbList",
  itemListElement: breadcrumb.map((item, i) => ({
    "@type": "ListItem",
    position: i + 1,
    name: item.label,
    ...(item.href ? { item: new URL(item.href, SITE_URL).toString() } : {}),
  })),
};
---

<Layout title={title} description={description} ogImage={ogImage} ogType="article">
  <script is:inline type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify(breadcrumbLd)} />

  <div class="content">
    <Breadcrumb items={breadcrumb} />
    <div class="columns">
      <div class="primary">
        <main class="main">
          <ComparePostHead title={title} image={image} publishedAt={publishedAt} updatedAt={updatedAt} />
          <CompareContent post={post} />
        </main>

        {
          related.length > 0 && (
            <section class="related">
              <h2 class="related-title">比較した銘柄のレビュー</h2>
              <ReviewPostList reviewPosts={related} />
            </section>
          )
        }
      </div>
      <BlogSingleSidebar />
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>

<style lang="scss">
  .content {
    max-width: 120rem;
    width: 100%;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 3.2rem 4rem 8rem;

    @include mixin.sp {
      padding: 2rem 1rem 6.4rem;
      --breadcrumb-bleed: 1rem;
    }
  }

  .columns {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 4rem;
    margin-top: 1.6rem;

    @include mixin.tab {
      flex-direction: column;
    }

    @include mixin.sp {
      margin-top: 1.2rem;
    }
  }

  .primary {
    flex-grow: 1;
    min-width: 0;

    @include mixin.tab {
      width: 100%;
    }
  }

  .main {
    background-color: var.$c-white;
    padding: 6.4rem 4.8rem;
    border: 0.1rem solid var.$c-line;
    border-radius: 0.6rem;

    @include mixin.sp {
      padding: 4rem 2rem;
    }
  }

  .related {
    margin-top: 4.8rem;

    @include mixin.sp {
      margin-top: 3.2rem;
    }

    // 3 本なので 3 列（ReviewPostList の既定）。SP は 1 列
    @include mixin.sp {
      :global(.list) {
        grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);
      }
    }
  }

  .related-title {
    font-size: 2rem;
    font-weight: bold;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;

    @include mixin.sp {
      font-size: 1.8rem;
    }
  }
</style>
